  "docTitle": "Distributed Cache - SDE Prep Dojo",
  "description": "Design a Redis or Memcached style distributed cache: cache-aside and write strategies, O(1) LRU, TTL expiry, hash slots and consistent hashing, async replication and failover, hot keys, cache stampedes, leases and invalidation with CDC.",
  "hero": {
