    "attrs": {
      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">35 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip kafka\">Kafka</span><span class=\"chip k8s\">Kubernetes</span><span class=\"chip docker\">Docker</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Microsoft</span><span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span><span class=\"chip company\">Meta</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Distributed Cache (Redis-like)</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Design the fast memory layer that sits in front of almost every big website: how keys are spread over many machines, what gets thrown out when memory is full, how copies survive a crash, and how to stop a single popular key or a sudden flood of misses from knocking your database over.</p>\n      "
